OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABids encouraged to keep famed
OL,4,Aartwork in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Resurrection of the Good and the
OL,7,FBad, finished in 1915, is the first
OL,8,Fpiece exploring that topic and is an
OL,9,F"immensely valuable" piece to use in
OL,10,Fthe study of his work, the Department
OL,11,Ffor Digital, Culture, Media and Sport
OL,12,F(DCMS) said.
OL,14,FBids for the painting, with a
OL,15,Frecommended price of #450,000, will be
OL,16,Fwelcomed until mid-December.
